## 7. .env Database Configuration

Set these values in your existing `.env` file. Do not replace the entire file.

```env
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=it_auth_lab
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=

SESSION_DRIVER=file
```

If your MySQL installation has a password, enter it after `DB_PASSWORD=`.

